WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:13.200
We're twins, Ebb and Flow. We chased each other around the Moon, measuring the tiny changes in distance between us.

2
00:00:13.900 --> 00:00:17.580
Those changes revealed the Moon's hidden insides.

3
00:00:18.280 --> 00:00:23.720
When our fuel ran low, we flew together into a mountain near the north pole.

4
00:00:24.420 --> 00:00:27.960
We flew in formation, right to the end.
